---
import { nmtoInterpolation, lagrangeInterpolate } from '../../../data/part04/ch17TeachingModels.mjs';
const initial=nmtoInterpolation({energy:0.45,spacing:1});
const width=720,height=330,pad={left:56,right:24,top:24,bottom:48};
const xs=Array.from({length:301},(_,i)=>-1.5+3*i/300),target=(x)=>1+0.4*x-0.15*x*x+0.05*x**3,interpolated=xs.map((x)=>lagrangeInterpolate(initial.nodes,initial.values,x));
const all=[...xs.map(target),...interpolated],min=Math.min(...all),max=Math.max(...all),span=max-min;
const toPoints=(values)=>values.map((value,index)=>`${(pad.left+index/(values.length-1)*(width-pad.left-pad.right)).toFixed(2)},${(pad.top+(max-value)/span*(height-pad.top-pad.bottom)).toFixed(2)}`).join(' ');
const markerX=pad.left+(initial.energy+1.5)/3*(width-pad.left-pad.right),markerY=pad.top+(max-initial.interpolated)/span*(height-pad.top-pad.bottom);
---
<figure class="chapter-visual nmto-interpolation" id="ch17-nmto-interpolation">
  <figcaption><strong>原创交互模型：three-energy NMTO interpolation</strong><span lang="en">Original interactive model: three-energy NMTO interpolation</span></figcaption>
  <div class="chapter-visual__controls"><label>probe energy E<input data-nmto-energy type="range" min="-1.4" max="1.4" step="0.025" value="0.45" /><output data-nmto-energy-output>0.450</output></label></div>
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${width} ${height}`} role="img" aria-label="Cubic target function and quadratic interpolation through three energy mesh points">
    <line class="axis" x1={pad.left} y1={height-pad.bottom} x2={width-pad.right} y2={height-pad.bottom}/><polyline class="curve target" points={toPoints(xs.map(target))}/><polyline class="curve interpolation" points={toPoints(interpolated)}/>
    {initial.nodes.map((node,index)=><circle class="mesh-node" cx={pad.left+(node+1.5)/3*(width-pad.left-pad.right)} cy={pad.top+(max-initial.values[index])/span*(height-pad.top-pad.bottom)} r="5"/>)}
    <circle class="probe" data-nmto-marker cx={markerX} cy={markerY} r="7"/><text x={(width+pad.left-pad.right)/2} y={height-10} text-anchor="middle">energy</text>
  </svg>
  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite"><span>exact=<output data-nmto-exact>{initial.exact.toFixed(8)}</output></span><span>interpolated=<output data-nmto-interpolated>{initial.interpolated.toFixed(8)}</output></span><span>error=<output data-nmto-error>{initial.error.toExponential(4)}</output></span><span>product prediction=<output data-nmto-predicted>{initial.predictedError.toExponential(4)}</output></span></div>
  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>quadratic Lagrange interpolation at E=-1,0,1 of a cubic target function.</p><p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> quadratic Lagrange interpolation at E=-1,0,1 of a cubic target function.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>三个 mesh energies 上 error 为 0；任意 probe 的 exact-interpolated error 等于 cubic coefficient 乘 energy-product。</p><p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the error vanishes at all three mesh energies, and elsewhere equals the cubic coefficient times the energy-product factor.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>该模型说明 interpolation order；不生成唯一 localized orbital、downfolded Hamiltonian、material band 或 NMTO force。</p><p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the model illustrates interpolation order only; it does not generate a unique localized orbital, downfolded Hamiltonian, material band, or NMTO force.</p>
  </div>
  <noscript><p>无 JavaScript fallback：静态图使用 probe E=0.45 与 mesh energies -1,0,1。</p></noscript>
</figure>
<script>
  import { nmtoInterpolation } from '../../../data/part04/ch17TeachingModels.mjs';
  const root=document.getElementById('ch17-nmto-interpolation');if(root){const control=root.querySelector('[data-nmto-energy]'),marker=root.querySelector('[data-nmto-marker]'),eout=root.querySelector('[data-nmto-energy-output]'),exact=root.querySelector('[data-nmto-exact]'),interp=root.querySelector('[data-nmto-interpolated]'),error=root.querySelector('[data-nmto-error]'),pred=root.querySelector('[data-nmto-predicted]');if(control instanceof HTMLInputElement&&marker instanceof SVGCircleElement){const width=720,height=330,pad={left:56,right:24,top:24,bottom:48},min=.00625,max=1.91875,span=max-min;const update=()=>{const energy=Number(control.value),result=nmtoInterpolation({energy,spacing:1});marker.setAttribute('cx',String(pad.left+(energy+1.5)/3*(width-pad.left-pad.right)));marker.setAttribute('cy',String(pad.top+(max-result.interpolated)/span*(height-pad.top-pad.bottom)));if(eout instanceof HTMLOutputElement)eout.value=energy.toFixed(3);if(exact instanceof HTMLOutputElement)exact.value=result.exact.toFixed(8);if(interp instanceof HTMLOutputElement)interp.value=result.interpolated.toFixed(8);if(error instanceof HTMLOutputElement)error.value=result.error.toExponential(4);if(pred instanceof HTMLOutputElement)pred.value=result.predictedError.toExponential(4)};control.addEventListener('input',update);update()}}
</script>
<style>.nmto-interpolation input,.nmto-interpolation svg{width:100%}.nmto-interpolation label{display:grid;gap:.35rem}.axis{stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.3}.curve{fill:none;stroke-width:2.4}.target{stroke:var(--sl-color-accent-high)}.interpolation{stroke:currentColor;stroke-dasharray:7 5}.mesh-node{fill:var(--sl-color-green-high);stroke:currentColor}.probe{fill:var(--sl-color-orange-high);stroke:currentColor}.nmto-interpolation svg text{fill:currentColor;font-size:13px}</style>
